--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party software
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

None. The application is a single HTML file built from the sources in this
repository: HTML and CSS written for this project, a translation table with
four locales, and plain JavaScript. It bundles no library, no framework, no
analytics and no font file, and it loads nothing from the network at runtime -
not even a CDN copy of anything.

The date arithmetic, the cycle grouping, the statistics (mean, median, standard
deviation) and the prediction model are written for this project. They follow
the arithmetic described in the public documentation of calendar dates and do
not include code from any date library.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------
External services
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

None. Every entry is written to localStorage on the device that made it. No
cycle date, symptom, note or temperature is ever transmitted. Export is a file
you download yourself; import reads a file you choose.
